+/*
+ * S/390 DIAGNOSE 308 definitions and structures
+ *
+ * Copyright 2025 IBM Corp.
+ * Author(s): Zhuoying Cai <zycai@linux.ibm.com>
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
